+ * and q6_adsp_dtb_region@9ed80000). The one thing new is a second image: SM8750's DSP is started from
+ * adsp.mdt and a companion, adsp_dtb.mdt (TrustZone's image 0x24), loaded into a memory of its own and
+ * authenticated just before the DSP itself (Linux: qcom_q6v5_pas.c, dtb_pas_id).
+ */
